<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">1.88
&ldquo;<U>Parent Board</U>&rdquo; has the meaning set forth in the Recitals.</FONT></P>

